<title>NEW ZEALAND: Macraes first half net profit leaps.</title>
<headline>Macraes first half net profit leaps.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  7.05 vs 1.35</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 5.56 vs 1.07</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  nil vs same</p>
<p>    Turnover				    51.2 vs 40.9</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			    10.89 vs 2.41</p>
<p>    Tax					   3.85 vs 1.06</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	 126.7 vs 126.5</p>
<p>Note - Macraes Mining Ltd is a gold mining company.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
